WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.924 --> 00:00:03.621
The work an employee

2
00:00:03.621 --> 00:00:05.574
gave the business agent

3
00:00:05.574 --> 00:00:07.695
is the delegation record.

4
00:00:07.695 --> 00:00:09.308
Read its objective,

5
00:00:09.308 --> 00:00:11.260
scope and period first.

6
00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:12.607
The agent

7
00:00:12.607 --> 00:00:17.396
reads the employee's instruction

8
00:00:17.396 --> 00:00:22.185
and decides its requests itself.

9
00:00:22.185 --> 00:00:23.382
Predict,

10
00:00:23.382 --> 00:00:24.879
then press

11
00:00:24.879 --> 00:00:28.321
'Hand it to the agent'.

12
00:00:28.321 --> 00:00:31.614
Each request the agent sent

13
00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:34.542
gets one row of answers:

14
00:00:34.542 --> 00:00:38.201
firewall, sign-in, fixed rule,

15
00:00:38.201 --> 00:00:40.762
approval-record rule,

16
00:00:40.762 --> 00:00:42.226
and Contexa.

17
00:00:42.226 --> 00:00:45.093
The next screen sets the work

18
00:00:45.093 --> 00:00:48.158
given, the request sent and the

19
00:00:48.158 --> 00:00:51.322
difference the engine named side

20
00:00:51.322 --> 00:00:54.189
by side, from its facts only.

21
00:00:54.189 --> 00:00:56.831
If Contexa asks the delegating

22
00:00:56.831 --> 00:00:58.241
person to check,

23
00:00:58.241 --> 00:00:59.210
you approve

24
00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:01.588
or reject as that employee.

25
00:01:01.588 --> 00:01:02.997
Send it yourself

26
00:01:02.997 --> 00:01:05.199
to see this run's result.
